<title>USA: New Valley Corp Q3 loss widens.</title>
<headline>New Valley Corp Q3 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI, Fla. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.91     loss	 $0.82</p>
<p> Net loss		  12,444     loss	 7,860</p>
<p> Revs			24,263		   21,514</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,578		    9,578</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net loss prior to payment of preferred dividends.  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $6.72     loss	 $0.03</p>
<p> Net loss		  22,090   profit	16,014</p>
<p> Revs			92,794		   39,215</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 9,578		    9,543</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 includes a charge of $4.7 million, or $0.49 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1995 Q3 includes a gain of $235,000, or $0.02 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1996 nine-month period includes a charge of $5.4 million, or $0.56 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1995 nine-month period includes a gain of $4.3 million, or $0.45 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Net income is prior to payments of preferred dividends and costs related to the redemption of preferred shares.</p>
